### Get all users
GET http://localhost:3000/users

### Create a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com"
}

### Get a user by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/users/17797703033071


### Update a user by ID
PUT http://localhost:3000/users/1779770303307
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe Updated",
  "email": "john.doe.updated@example.com"
}

### Delete a user by ID
DELETE http://localhost:3000/users/1779769650823